<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Felcor Suite started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Felcor Suite started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said analyst Bruce Turner initiated coverage of FelCor Suite Hotels Inc with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- the stock was up 2/16 to 36-11/16.</p>
